# F13 step 3 review: a target reached through a link into the folder dragged isn't one (no
# outline), as the job's into_itself would refuse it. The tree (run.sh): adir/, alink -> adir,
# bdir/.
settle
expect n=3
point-ui row 0
press-here
move-by 0 10
expect dragname=adir
point-ui row 1
move-here
expect drop=row:1 dropok=0 dropmark=0 badge=none
point-ui row 2
move-here
expect drop=row:2 dropok=1 dropdir=bdir
key esc
release
quit
